(ARTICLE I - NAME AND PURPOSE) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(Section 1. The name of this organization shall be The Meridian) Tj
T*
(Society of Ashgrove Polytechnic Institute, hereinafter the Society.) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(Section 2. The purpose of the Society is to convene the Lantern) Tj
T*
(Lecture Series, to conduct an annual Spring Appeal in support of) Tj
T*
(that series, and to maintain an equipment lending library for the) Tj
T*
(use of the Society and of other recognized student organizations.) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(ARTICLE II - MEMBERSHIP) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(Section 1. Membership is open to any enrolled student of the) Tj
T*
(Institute upon payment of dues for the current semester.) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(Section 2. A member in good standing is one whose dues are paid) Tj
T*
(for the semester then in progress. Only members in good standing) Tj
T*
(may vote.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
