(ARTICLE III - OFFICERS) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(Section 1. The officers of the Society shall be a President, a) Tj
T*
(Vice President, a Treasurer, a Secretary, and an Archivist.) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(Section 2. The President shall preside at all meetings and shall) Tj
T*
(be a signatory on every account of the Society.) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(Section 3. The Treasurer shall keep the accounts of the Society,) Tj
T*
(shall report the balance of every account at each regular meeting,) Tj
T*
(and shall be a signatory on every account of the Society.) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(Section 4. \(Added by amendment, 2 March 2019.\) There shall be an) Tj
T*
(Assistant Treasurer, who shall assist the Treasurer in the keeping) Tj
T*
(of the accounts and in the collection of dues. The Assistant) Tj
T*
(Treasurer shall hold no independent authority to disburse funds of) Tj
T*
(the Society and shall not be a signatory on any account.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
