(ARTICLE IV - ELECTIONS) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(Section 1. Officers shall be elected at the last regular meeting) Tj
T*
(of the spring term and shall take office on the first day of July) Tj
T*
(following, serving until the thirtieth day of June next after.) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(Section 2. No officer shall serve more than two consecutive terms) Tj
T*
(in the same office.) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(ARTICLE V - MEETINGS AND QUORUM) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(Section 1. Regular meetings shall be held not less than once each) Tj
T*
(month of the academic term.) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(Section 2. One third of the members in good standing shall) Tj
T*
(constitute a quorum for the transaction of business.) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(ARTICLE VI - COMMITTEES) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(Section 1. The President may appoint such committees as the) Tj
T*
(business of the Society requires. No committee shall incur an) Tj
T*
(obligation on behalf of the Society without the prior approval of) Tj
T*
(the membership.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
