(ARTICLE VII - FINANCE) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(Section 1. Dues shall be fixed by a two-thirds vote of the members) Tj
T*
(in good standing at the first regular meeting of the fall term,) Tj
T*
(and shall not be altered during the year then in progress.) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(Section 2. The Society shall maintain an operating account and a) Tj
T*
(restricted Spring Appeal Fund. The Spring Appeal Fund shall be) Tj
T*
(drawn upon only by vote of the membership.) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(Section 3. No disbursement in excess of two hundred fifty dollars) Tj
T*
(\($250\) shall issue without the signatures of both the President) Tj
T*
(and the Treasurer. A disbursement of two hundred fifty dollars or) Tj
T*
(less may issue on the signature of the Treasurer alone.) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(Section 4. The books of the Society shall be presented for review) Tj
T*
(by the outgoing Treasurer to the incoming Treasurer before the) Tj
T*
(first day of July in each year.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
