(ARTICLE VIII - AMENDMENT) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(Section 1. This Constitution may be amended by a two-thirds vote) Tj
T*
(of the members in good standing at a regular meeting, provided) Tj
T*
(that the text of the proposed amendment has been circulated in) Tj
T*
(writing not less than fourteen days before that meeting.) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(Section 2. No motion, standing rule, or practice of the Society) Tj
T*
(shall have the effect of amending this Constitution. An amendment) Tj
T*
(is effective only upon the vote prescribed in Section 1 and upon) Tj
T*
(entry of the amended text in this document.) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(Attested by the Secretary, 14 September 2016.) Tj
T*
(Amendment of 2 March 2019 entered by the Secretary.) Tj
ET
